// =============================================================================
// lib/conditions.js
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// SOURCE OF TRUTH for everything about Verity's indexed conditions: name,
// slug, score, gap type, summary, and the alias phrases used to detect a
// condition in a user's message. Nothing here is inferred or generated by
// the LLM — if it's not in this file, the bot does not know it.
//
// If you add/edit a condition on the live site, mirror the change here.
// =============================================================================

